                                "sense_id": "47692b3c-0bc9-3a2f-b1f2-4c230706088d",
                                "text": "[T]he shopmen . . ., increditable as it may sound, used to demand of us upon our entrance, like banditti, if we came with money or with empty hand."
                            }
